  97.7 dp tall on the Motorola edge 70); the drawing keeps 110 for its proportions. Every colour is a widget palette
  resource (ruling 4):
  - card 0-339 x 0-110, 24 corners, @color/widget_card;
  - artwork box x 10-79, y 20.5-89.5, 12 corners, @color/widget_art_placeholder, with widget_ic_music_note's path
    scaled to a 44-unit box centred in it, @color/widget_title;
  - title bar x 89-239, y 24-34, @color/widget_title; artist bar x 89-189, y 40-48, @color/widget_artist;
  - the real paths of previous, back 15, play, forward 15 and next at 28 units, centred in five 48-unit cells from
    x 89 to 329 (centres x 113, 161, 209, 257, 305) at centre y 72, @color/widget_title;
  - progress track x 89-329, y 96-99, @color/widget_track, and fill x 89-169, @color/widget_accent.
  WidgetPreviewTest samples it. When a glyph changes, copy its new path here.
-->
